@startuml board-api-after
title 공통 보드 API 도입 후 (#49)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
left to right direction

package "model (A)" {
  interface Board {
    +rows() : int
    +columns() : int
    +step() : boolean
    +toggle(position : CellPosition) : void
    +clear() : void
    +snapshot() : BoardSnapshot
    +restore(snapshot : BoardSnapshot) : void
  }
  class CompositeBoard <<Facade>>
  class CellPosition <<record>> {
    +row() : int
    +column() : int
  }
  class BoardSnapshot <<record>> {
    +rows() : int
    +columns() : int
    +liveCells() : Set<CellPosition>
  }
  interface Cell <<Component>>
  class Neighborhood <<Composite>>
  class Resident <<Leaf>>
  class NeighborhoodState

  CompositeBoard ..|> Board
  CompositeBoard --> Neighborhood : 기존 보드에 위임
  Board ..> CellPosition : toggle()
  Board ..> BoardSnapshot : snapshot(), restore()
  BoardSnapshot --> "0..*" CellPosition : liveCells
  Neighborhood ..|> Cell
  Resident ..|> Cell
  Neighborhood *-- Cell : grid
  Cell ..> NeighborhoodState : createMemento()
}

package "application (B)" {
  class GameController
}
package "persistence (C)" {
  class LegacyLifeCodec
}
package "ui (D)" {
  class BoardRenderer
}

GameController --> Cell : outermostCell
LegacyLifeCodec ..> NeighborhoodState : 파일 변환
BoardRenderer ..> Cell : 렌더링
BoardRenderer ..> Neighborhood : 하위 셀과 활성 정보

note top of Board
  후속 연동
  B: 보드 조작과 호출 직렬화
  C: .life와 BoardSnapshot 변환
  D: 생사 조회에 BoardSnapshot 사용
end note
@enduml
